Author: Sofiane Bebert <sofiane@bebert.co>
Date:   Sun Nov 8 15:47:15 2026 +0000

    feat(ui): Reminders is a list context with header tabs and an in-flow picker

    Reminders leaves the drawer for the main pane: Pending / Returned / History
    in the header tab slot, non-thread rows via a reusable ContextRowList, the
    scheduling picker in flow above the rows. Request logic moves unchanged into
    useReminders; put/cancel/retry semantics and fixture-only gating are intact.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Entire-Checkpoint: 01M6XXFAWE83B5H46T2KGBGQ4K

